      "text": "[8:36PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from UBA roundabout towards NNPC filling station inward Cathedral Church down to Nitel intersection is good.\n\nGood movement from State House towards McWen bridge and State House connecting Force Road.\n\nPerfect movement from  Zone 2 underneath bridge towards Flagstaff House Inward Officers Mess connecting McWen bridge enroute Bonny Camp.\n\nTraffic is looking good from Onikan roundabout by TBS inward Water Board down to Nitel intersection.\n\nThe entire stretch of Broad Street is good movement from General Hospital towards Tinubu Square connecting Abibu Oki Street by martins junction.\nApproaching Balogun junction inward journey Apongbon traffic is moving good.\n\nThe stretch of Igbosere road and Catholic Mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street is looking good.\n\nOur officers are on ground for monitoring, and ensuring free flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
