      "text": "[9:31PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is moving steadily from Alaagba descending the Iyana Ipaja flyover inward Iyana Ipaja Roundabout, aided by effective roundabout alternation.\nThe entire stretch of New Ipaja Road, both inward and outward the roundabout, is experiencing appreciable movement.\nVehicular flow is smooth along Lagos-Abeokuta Expressway from Danco toward Goye, while return traffic heading toward Pleasure is easing.\nMovement from Mosalasi through Egbeda to Isheri Roundabout remains swift with no delay at the Egbeda alternation point. The return journey also enjoys similar flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
